  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You hedge your bets - charging in but not quite throwing your all into it.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Bluff 1 rank.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you make a charge, if you miss your attack you do not suffer the penalty to your AC like you normally do. If you hit with any attack made during the charge, you still suffer the penalty. When making a half-hearted charge you may not benefit from the Power Attack or Spirited Charge feats.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gonzo-feats#toc32\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
